growth company&#160;</span><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_904_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20221212__20221212_zHecAt2O6Okd"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-12to2022-12-12" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

